+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` with `{"toOrgId":"globex"}` moves a
+user from `{orgID}` to another organization (for example between group companies).
+
+- Only org admins of `{orgID}` may transfer its users (403 for everyone else in the org).
+- Another organization's path → 404. The user must belong to `{orgID}` (otherwise 404).
+- `toOrgId` must be given, must differ from `{orgID}` (400), and must be an existing organization (400).
+- The transfer is all-or-nothing and keeps the model rules: the user loses
+  memberships in projects of the old organization, and tasks assigned to them
+  in those projects are unassigned.
+- The user loses org admin rights, which are per organization.
+- Projects of the old organization become unreadable to the user (404).
+
